    "type": "question",
    "label": "9",
    "prompt": "A 250 mL packet of milk contains 8 g of protein and 12.5 g of carbohydrate. Give the ratio of protein to carbohydrate in simplest form.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$16:25$",
      "worked": "Both masses are in grams. Multiply both terms by 10, then divide both by 5.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{protein}:\\text{carbohydrate}&=8:12.5\\\\\\text{protein}:\\text{carbohydrate}&=80:125\\\\\\text{protein}:\\text{carbohydrate}&=16:25\\end{align*}$$",
